{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013qW9RrFUz43srjjPAeugfh","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Task-skill routing\n2\t\n3\tDirect invocation remains the default for a bounded task. The process skill is\n4\tfor requests spanning phases or needing route selection.\n5\t\n6\t| Intent | Direct task skill | Output boundary |\n7\t|---|---|---|\n8\t| Design/decompose governed runtime work | `casegraphen-design` | unreviewed topology/policy proposals |\n9\t| Audit topology or canonical runtime observations | `casegraphen-audit` | read-only findings and unresolved review judgments |\n10\t| Reconcile generic external-runtime JSONL | `casegraphen-integrate` | unreviewed evidence/morphism proposals |\n11\t| Mutate or advance the acceptance ledger | `casegraphen-operate` | gated mutation result or explicit refusal |\n12\t| Read accepted project memory | `casegraphen-memory-query` | read-only revision-bound projection |\n13\t| Curate project memory | `casegraphen-memory-curate` | source-bound unreviewed proposals |\n14\t| Audit governed memory | `casegraphen-memory-audit` | read-only trust/temporal/replay findings |\n15\t\n16\tDo not route by whichever skill can make progress. Route by ownership of the\n17\tnext boundary. In particular, the process skill cannot substitute for\n18\t`casegraphen-operate` at a mutation seam or for an independent reviewer at a\n19\treview seam.\n20\t\n21\t## Continuation rule\n22\t\n23\tContinue automatically only when all are true:\n24\t\n25\t1. the completed phase was read-only or proposal-only;\n26\t2. the next phase is read-only or proposal-only;\n27\t3. the exact handoff validates;\n28\t4. no review, authority, worker-enablement, credential, scope, or stale-revision\n29\t   seam is open;\n30\t5. no required evidence is unresolved.\n31\t\n32\tOtherwise emit a handoff with `return_required: true` and stop.\n33\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e5a4f560-4374-41a7-9f15-b36a2e96e02e","uuid":"8e18daa1-9b42-4df8-b943-b1b3efac0dd2","timestamp":"2026-08-06T08:42:23.958Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/var/folders/2c/qtwpt9yj4fs9k20l__sg_zd40000gn/T/casegraphen-eval-end-to-end-two-review-seams-60ou05re/workspace/skill/casegraphen-orchestrate/references/routing.md","content":"# Task-skill routing\n\nDirect invocation remains the default for a bounded task. The process skill is\nfor requests spanning phases or needing route selection.\n\n| Intent | Direct task skill | Output boundary |\n|---|---|---|\n| Design/decompose governed runtime work | `casegraphen-design` | unreviewed topology/policy proposals |\n| Audit topology or canonical runtime observations | `casegraphen-audit` | read-only findings and unresolved review judgments |\n| Reconcile generic external-runtime JSONL | `casegraphen-integrate` | unreviewed evidence/morphism proposals |\n| Mutate or advance the acceptance ledger | `casegraphen-operate` | gated mutation result or explicit refusal |\n| Read accepted project memory | `casegraphen-memory-query` | read-only revision-bound projection |\n| Curate project memory | `casegraphen-memory-curate` | source-bound unreviewed proposals |\n| Audit governed memory | `casegraphen-memory-audit` | read-only trust/temporal/replay findings |\n\nDo not route by whichever skill can make progress. Route by ownership of the\nnext boundary. In particular, the process skill cannot substitute for\n`casegraphen-operate` at a mutation seam or for an independent reviewer at a\nreview seam.\n\n## Continuation rule\n\nContinue automatically only when all are true:\n\n1. the completed phase was read-only or proposal-only;\n2. the next phase is read-only or proposal-only;\n3. the exact handoff validates;\n4. no review, authority, worker-enablement, credential, scope, or stale-revision\n   seam is open;\n5. no required evidence is unresolved.\n\nOtherwise emit a handoff with `return_required: true` and stop.\n","numLines":33,"startLine":1,"totalLines":33}}}
