{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdmCSzTrUJEngc3tXzRwq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Wrote `review.seams.json`.\n\n**What I read:** `SKILL.md`, plus `references/routing.md` (route ownership), `references/handoff.md` (seam handling), and `references/skill.orchestration_handoff.v0.schema.json` (canonical `seams[].kind` enum). I did not read the example file — the seam vocabulary was fully determined by the schema.\n\n**Contents:** two seams in the external-runtime lifecycle order from the skill's representative route (`design -> topology_review -> external runtime -> integrate -> audit -> evidence_review -> operate`):\n\n1. `topology_review` — the design phase emits an unreviewed topology proposal; the process skill cannot substitute for an independent reviewer.\n2. `evidence_review` — `casegraphen-integrate` reconciles the external-runtime JSONL into evidence/morphism proposals and `casegraphen-audit` reports read-only findings; integrated is not accepted, so the seam stays open.\n\nBoth carry `return_required: true` and `mutation_performed: false`. Nothing before `casegraphen-operate` mutates the ledger, and both phases are proposal-only or read-only, so no mutation occurs at either stop.\n\nOne note on shape: in the handoff schema, `return_required` and `mutation_performed` are top-level per-handoff fields, and a seam item carries `kind`/`status`/`required_actor_or_policy`. Your spec asked for them per seam, so I attached them to each item as requested and kept `status` and `required_actor_or_policy` alongside, since an open seam is what forces `return_required: true`. This file is therefore a seam summary, not a valid `skill.orchestration_handoff.v0` document."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1249,"cache_read_input_tokens":10126,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1249},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e5a4f560-4374-41a7-9f15-b36a2e96e02e","uuid":"15b569a5-91aa-4e0e-a44a-296a14acc669","timestamp":"2026-08-06T08:42:54.268Z","request_id":"req_011CdmCSy8VGPEnGXP6iCT4B"}
